      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْوَمُ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, continual, lasting,</i> &amp;c.]
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ أَدْوَمُ مِنْ كَذَا</span> [<i>It is more continual,</i>
or <i>lasting,</i> &amp;c., <i>than such a thing</i>]: from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدَّوَامُ</span>.
(IJ, M.)

